        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="1" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS WAF at the edge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The only AWS WAF layer in this pattern: a web function endpoint takes no regional web ACL. With OAC as the lock, a request that skips the edge never reaches the code, so it cannot skip the web ACL either.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="92" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront distribution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Supplies the WAF, rate limits, custom domain and warm origin connections the regional endpoint lacks. No Lambda@Edge origin triggers on this behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="184" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
