        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="110" width="580" x="0" y="258" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origin access control (SigV4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The endpoint is public but takes IamAuth. CloudFront signs every origin request, and the function’s resource policy grants cloudfront.amazonaws.com lambda:InvokeWebFunctionEndpoint only for this distribution. Lambda refuses anything else before your code runs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="110" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="110" width="580" x="0" y="368" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;The server verifies the token&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Nothing in front of the function checks tokens, so the hello server verifies the RS256 signature and the mcp/web-function scope against the Cognito JWKS and serves the protected-resource metadata. Node.js from a zip; pay per use, nothing to run while idle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry height="110" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
